# Local design-history copies. Kept out of the repo on purpose: anything
# committed here is served publicly by GitHub Pages, and a second copy of
# index.html would be a publicly reachable, search-indexable duplicate.
# The canonical history is the git tag v1-pre-redesign.
index.pre-redesign.html
